  "label": "Anti-Semitism",
  "description": "A long-standing prejudice and discrimination against Jewish people, often rooted in religious, cultural, and racial stereotypes. The Holocaust was the culmination of centuries of anti-Semitic persecution in Europe. The meme's reference to 'the horrors of the Holocaust' implicitly invokes this historical and ideological context, which is central to understanding the gravity of the event depicted.",
